<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Reservation Confirmed</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 20px; background-color: #f4f4f4; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; }
    .header { text-align: center; color: #333; border-bottom: 2px solid #007bff; padding-bottom: 20px; }
    .content { margin: 20px 0; line-height: 1.6; }
    .details { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .footer { text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 30px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🎬 Reservation Confirmed!</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{customerName}},</p>

      <p>Your reservation has been successfully created! Here are the details:</p>

      <div class="details">
        <h3>Movie: {{movieTitle}}</h3>
        <p><strong>Show Time:</strong> {{showTime}}</p>
        <p><strong>Seats:</strong> {{seatNumbers}}</p>
        <p><strong>Total Price:</strong> ${{totalPrice}}</p>
        <p><strong>Reservation ID:</strong> {{reservationId}}</p>
      </div>

      <p><strong>Important:</strong> Your reservation will expire in 30 minutes. Please complete your payment before then to secure your seats.</p>

      <p>Thank you for choosing our cinema!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>Cinema Booking System</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
